---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base
  title="Legal Notice (Impressum)"
  description="Legal notice (Impressum) under Section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (DDG)."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="display page-title">Legal Notice</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">Impressum</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <div class="wrap prose-body">
      <h2>Information under Section 5 DDG</h2>
      <p>
        Alexander Jaeger<br />
        Wolfenbütteler Str. 17<br />
        30519 Hannover<br />
        Germany
      </p>

      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <!--email_off--><p>E-mail: <a href="mailto:contact@leonidaracing.com">contact@leonidaracing.com</a></p><!--/email_off-->
      <p>This address is also our point of contact for users and for authorities under Articles 11 and 12 of the EU Digital Services Act. You can write to us in English or German.</p>

      <h2>Responsible for content under Section 18(2) MStV</h2>
      <p>Alexander Jaeger, address as above.</p>

      <h2>Liability for content</h2>
      <!-- Codex review 16.10.2026: old TMG structure with DDG section numbers replaced. -->
      <p>We are responsible for our own content under applicable law. Different rules may apply to content submitted by users, including the EU Digital Services Act. If you believe content on this site is unlawful, use <a href={`${base}report-content/`}>Report content</a> or contact us by e-mail. We review notices and take the action required by law. Nothing in this notice excludes liability where the law does not permit it.</p>

      <h2>Liability for links</h2>
      <p>This site links to external websites, such as Discord and community servers. External websites are operated by third parties under their own responsibility. If you believe a linked page is unlawful, please tell us which link is affected and why. We will review the notice and remove or change the link where required by law. Our own statutory responsibilities remain unaffected.</p>

      <h2>Copyright</h2>
      <p>Original content created for this website is protected where applicable by copyright law. Rights in third-party material remain with its respective owners. Statutory rights to use content, including applicable quotation rights, remain unaffected. If you believe material on this site infringes your rights, please contact us.</p>

      <h2>Relationship to Rockstar Games / Take-Two Interactive</h2>
      <p>This website is a private, non-commercial, independent community project and has no connection to Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive Software or their affiliates. Game titles, trademarks, screenshots and other game content remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .page-title { margin: .6rem 0 .5rem; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem); }
  .page-lede { color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .92rem; }

  .prose { padding-bottom: var(--gh-gap-section); }
  .prose-body { max-width: 62ch; }
  .prose-body h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2rem 0 .6rem; }
  .prose-body h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .prose-body p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose-body a { color: var(--gh-yellow); }
</style>
